repository-code: "https://github.com/lmoffatt/macro_ir_reliability"
abstract: >-
  C++20 engine for the likelihood of macroscopic ion-channel current
  recordings under the MacroIR family of algorithms, together with the
  run scripts and R notebooks that produced the figures of
  "Likelihood approximations distort the ion channel kinetic
  information in macroscopic currents".
keywords:
  - ion channels
  - patch clamp
  - Fisher information
  - maximum likelihood
  - Markov models
  - macroscopic currents
